# Files the codebase-memory index must skip (gitignore syntax), on top of .gitignore.
#
# index.html is a BUILD ARTIFACT: tools/build.mjs concatenates packages/protocol/src,
# packages/engine/src and apps/web/src into it and embeds the card pack. Indexing it
# copied every engine and web symbol a second time (~800 symbols, 5% of the graph),
# so one lookup returned two answers ("parseCard" appeared both as
# packages/engine/src/03-imported-cards.parseCard and as index.html.parseCard) and
# agents spent tokens reading the build output. CLAUDE.md already says: never read
# index.html. build/ is excluded through .gitignore.
index.html
